-- 7ARF MESH BAYEN ------------------------------------- main.franco.kl  SEC0111

La2eit 7arf mesh bayen U+200B (ZERO WIDTH SPACE). Momken ykhalli esmeen mokhtalfeen shabah ba3d.

2│     khali name = "Sa​ra"
                       ^

Garrab: `\u{200B}`

Mosa3da: F el code aw gowa esm emsa7o (`kalam fix` beyemsa7o). Gowa el string ektebo `\u{...}` 3ashan elly beye2ra yshofo.

